# Testing Workflow

Prefer fast, targeted validation over the full suite. Glob-scoped — loads on product paths;
governance/kanban turns use [targeted-testing/SKILL.md](../skills/targeted-testing/SKILL.md).
Signature: `governance-always-on-rule-diet`.

## Path → test SSOT

| Priority | Source |
| --- | --- |
| 1 | [targeted-testing/SKILL.md](../skills/targeted-testing/SKILL.md) — workflow |
| 2 | [targeted-testing/reference.md](../skills/targeted-testing/reference.md) — hook mirror (orbit, stairs, governance scripts) |
| 3 | [agent-triage/reference.md](../skills/agent-triage/reference.md) § Common path → pytest mapping |
| 4 | `scripts/pre-commit-pytest.sh` — hook source of truth |
| 5 | Kanban **Tests → Files** — `python3 scripts/resolve_card_tests.py --from-card CARD.md --files-only` |

## Quick examples

* `helpers/cells.py` → `pytest tests/test_cells.py -q`
* `ui/` → `pytest tests/test_ui_document.py tests/test_main_window.py -q`
* `registries/` → `pytest tests/test_palette_integrity.py -q`
* Agent Review / commit-ready → `scripts/agent-commit-ready.sh` (Signature: `precommit-pytest-scope-mismatch`)

Detailed orbit, floating-camera, and governance script rows live in **targeted-testing/reference.md**
only — do not duplicate here (acb2).

## Test selection

Prefer the smallest meaningful set. Escalate to full suite only for core infra, test infra, many
packages, or unclear dependency risk.

## Pre-commit

```bash
scripts/pre-commit-pytest.sh   # staged paths — same as hook
scripts/record-pytest-pass.sh  # 30 min skip after green manual run
```

Ruff and palette checks still run. Agents: `.venv/bin/ruff check --select E501` on touched `.py`
before handoff — Signature: `ruff-e501-line-length`.

On hook failure during **`git commit`**, a **`commit-issue`** kanban card may be created — Signature:
`precommit-no-card-on-manual-hook`. Agent workflow: [kanban-commit-issue-cards.mdc](kanban-commit-issue-cards.mdc).
Common ruff codes: `precommit-ruff-b007`, `precommit-ruff-sim102-sim103`, `ruff-e501-line-length` — grep
[pre-commit-workflow/reference.md](../skills/pre-commit-workflow/reference.md). Governance integration
fixture drift: `governance-index-not-grep-integration-fixture`, `governance-discovery-ladder-integration-fixture`.

## Agent behavior

1. State which tests and why before running.
2. On failure: summarize, suggest smallest fix, re-run targeted tests only.
3. Do not claim tests passed without executing them.

## Do not

* Default to full `pytest` after small edits
* Run unrelated tests without justification
* Hand-pick pytest when the card lists **Tests → Files** or the hook maps staged paths
